      "time": "2026-09-13T16:53:58Z",
      "account": "Premier League",
      "handle": "premierleague"
    },
    {
      "text": "60. Our ten men have the lead! 💪\n\n@JoskoGvardiol4 fires a deflected strike towards goal and it falls to @Erling, who is lurking at the back post to guide home 🎯\n\n🔴 0-1 🩵",
      "url": "https://x.com/ManCity/status/2099179468933714047",
